    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku owu, chelili atumbanji hiyakuya nakuvula, hikukuvulumuka kutoba; aYudeya awaHeleni hiyakutobela aHeberu, muloŋabondeli anfwila jawu hanjaŋenaŋawu hefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikumi nayedi hiyakutambika izaza dawatumbanji, hiyakwila nawu, Hichachiwahi etu kushiya mazu aNzambi nakukalakela kujimesaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu ana kwetu, talatalenu mukachi kenu amayala atanu nayedi akweti mpuhu yayiwahi, enzala dehi Spiritu nama ana, tuyikunjiki kumudimu iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa etu kwetu tukukakela kulomba, nimudimu wakushimuna mazu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwahosheluwu mutiyisha niizaza dejima kuwaha. Hiyakutonda Setefwanu, iyala wasweja kukuhwelela, wenzala Spiritu Wajila; niFwilipu, niPorokorusi, niNikanori, niTimoni, niPamenasi, niNikola wakuAntiyoki, wabalumukili kwikala kaYudeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa hiyakuyisha kumesu awapostolu. Chanalombuwu hiyakuyinaŋika makasawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu aNzambi hiyakuya nakudinuŋanuŋa; niatumbanji hiyakuya nakuvula nankashi muYerusalema; mukanka wawatupristu waweni hiyakwovwahila kwitiya kwakukuhwelela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Setefwanu, wenzala luwi naŋovu, hakwila yuma yakuhayamisha, niyinjikijilu yeneni mukachi kawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa hikukusaŋumuka antu amakwawu akushikola yachaaku chawaLibiritini, niakwaKireni, niakwaAlesanderiya, niakwaSilisiya, niakwaAsiya, hiyakutadika ntadi naSetefwanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakukaŋanya kwimana nindi naŋovu yama anindi, naSpiritu ahosheliyi nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuhana maseleka kudi antu kulonda amusoŋeleli nawu, Tunamutiyi nakuhosha mazu akutuka Mosi niNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakusaŋumona antu niakulumpi niansoneki; chanamuwanuwu hiyakumukwata naŋovu nakumutwala muchota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwimika ayinsahu akutwamba elili nawu, Iwu iyala halekaŋa kutena munu mwajila ninshimbi chatamaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tunamutiyi nakuhosha nindi, Iwu Yesu wakuNazareta wakakisaŋana tembeli iyi nakubalumuna yaaku yatulejeliyi Mosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima ashakamini muchota hiyakumushinshika namesu awu swi-i; hiyakumona kumesu indi kudi neyi kumesu akaŋelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
